					<![CDATA[
						 <div style="display:none"><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/nav%3Aside/styleFrame.html?bhl" name="typeFrame"></iframe></div> <div class="info-container"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">&nbsp;</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">&nbsp;</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div> <p>即将更新——Rounderhouse</p> </div> <hr /> <div id="u-author_block"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><span class="logical-link-wrap"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/rounderhouse-s-author-page">rounderhouse-s-author-page</a><span class="logical-link-internal logical-link-internal-false"><span class="logical-link-title logical-link-link-true"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/rounderhouse-s-author-page">The Rounderpage</a></span><span class="logical-link-custom logical-link-link-true"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/rounderhouse-s-author-page">▸ 该作者的更多作品 ◂</a></span></span><span class="logical-link-original logical-link-original-false"><span class="logical-link-appended">（<a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/rounderhouse-s-author-page">原文链接</a>）</span><span class="logical-link-title logical-link-link-true"><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/rounderhouse-s-author-page">rounderhouse-s-author-page</a></span><span class="logical-link-custom logical-link-link-true"><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/rounderhouse-s-author-page">▸ 该作者的更多作品 ◂</a></span></span><span class="logical-link-mark-common logical-link-mark-mark-false" style="color: #009966"><sup><span class="fa fa-link"><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&nbsp;</span></span></sup></span><span class="logical-link-mark-newpage logical-link-mark-mark-false" style="color: #F00"><sup><span class="fa fa-link"><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&nbsp;</span></span></sup></span></span></p> </div> <hr /></div> <div class="translation_block"> <h1><span>其他语言</span></h1> </div> <div class="u-faq"> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <p style="text-align: center;"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/component:info-ayers">常见问题</a></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="scale CN-base"> <div class="class1"> <div class="level-text"><span class="base 级 CN">4/2304</span> 级 <span class="base 级 CN">4/2304</span></div> <div class="class-text">机密</div> </div> <div class="class1image"><img src="https://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/component%3Aclassified-bar-woed-source/classified-lv4.svg" alt="classified-lv4.svg" class="image" /></div> <div class="item1 CN"> <div class="itemnum CN">项目编号: SCP-2304</div> <div class="objclass CN"> <div class="obj-left"></div> <div class="obj-right Keter"> <div class="obj-text">Keter</div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <hr /> <div class="carousel-container center" style="width: calc(330px + 34px);"><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/local--code/component%3Acarousel/1#?images=shrek.png,deep.png,beyblade.png&amp;wiki=scp-wiki&amp;page=scp-2304&amp;interval=3&amp;background={$background}&amp;options={$options}" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width: calc(330px + 34px); height: calc(235px + 6px);"></iframe> <div class="carousel-caption-wrapper"> <div class="carousel-caption {$no-caption}" style="width: calc(330px);"> <p>SCP-2304-4、SCP-2304-9以及SCP-2304-11，已编辑去除其认知危害性质。</p> </div> </div> </div> <p><strong>特殊收容措施：</strong>基金会各人工智能应对SCP-2304实体发现处周边的高流量在线媒体群体进行分析。任意被发现具有认知危害性质的图像应从其各自图像主机服务中系统性移除，并存入一台基金会服务器。</p> <p><strong>描述：</strong>SCP-2304是对至少14张具有某种程度的认知危害性质的图像的集体统称<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-233591-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >1</a></sup>。SCP-2304实例以一般网络模因<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-233591-2" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >2</a></sup>的形式，并为人工的过度处理、进行喜剧编辑。所有的SCP-2304实例可通过观看的形式令肌肉细胞立即进行增长，通常导致观看者的<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">死亡</span><span style="color:blue">呼吸道受限、并引发后续医疗问题。（更新于<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-3984">2020-09-12</a>）</span></p> <p><strong>发现记录：</strong></p> <div class="blockquote"> <p>于2019年，由于一系列由于喉部细胞的极限生长导致的气管受阻引发的可疑死亡案例，SCP-2304首次引起基金会的注意。最初该异常被分类为一种未知的传播载体，但既2020-09-12发生的ΩK“死亡终结”情景，数名幸存受害者被定位与采访，以期发现该异常的来源。一名SCP-2304实例的受害者告诉基金会职员，他们从一间██████████号互联网实时聊天室，以“OxyGenesis”的用户获得了其SCP-2304实例。已派遣Smith特工以“PebbleTooth”账号对该社区尝试进行渗透活动。</p> </div> <p><strong>附件：</strong></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">第██████████次摘录</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;关闭</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div class="chat"> <blockquote> <p>摘录：2021年7月28日</p> </blockquote> <div style="text-align: left;"> <blockquote> <p style="text-align: center;"><strong>PebbleTooth已加入聊天室。</strong></p> <p><span class="member"><strong>Komodo：</strong></span><span class="member2"><strong>惊讶</strong></span>有人知道这是谁吗<br /> <span class="ping"><strong>commodore69：</strong></span>如果你一直要为这种傻逼打扰我们的话，我他妈的就要踢掉你了<br /> <span class="member0"><strong>PebbleTooth：</strong></span><span class="member">Komodo：</span>你好<br /> <span class="member2"><strong>FastNJammin：</strong></span><span class="member0">PebbleTooth：</span>哟，你是怎么<br /> <span class="member2"><strong>FastNJammin：</strong></span>找到这个地方的<br /> <span class="member"><strong>stormstorm：</strong></span>我打赌，通过网络<br /> <span class="member2"><strong>FastNJammin：</strong></span><span class="member">stormstorm：</span>这里挺繁忙的<br /> <span class="member0"><strong>PebbleTooth：</strong></span><span class="member2">FastNJammin：</span>是一个朋友推荐我的——就是OxyGenesis。<br /> <span class="member"><strong>Komodo：</strong></span>哦操，是oxygenesis<br /> <span class="member"><s