er" id="footnote-241132-4"><a href="javascript:;" >4</a>. 目前不计搬运的主题和组件的数目。</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-241132-5"><a href="javascript:;" >5</a>. RPC管理局的翻译，去我RPC的工作台看看就好了</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-241132-6"><a href="javascript:;" >6</a>. .<br /> <strong>原作</strong>：<em>The Court of the Crimson King</em><br /> <strong>译者</strong>：赵暗花</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-241132-7"><a href="javascript:;" >7</a>. 事实证明草稿放在自己网站比较安全。</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-241132-8"><a href="javascript:;" >8</a>. 为了避免使用 Include 预设的书籍时，css 被重复引用，而单独分开。</div> </div> <p><br /> <br /></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">.</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;什么也不是</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/etinjat/html/7c19884bdab4241a78bfb6d2aa8ce8c2ce1bcb99-1293228077967036091" allowtransparency="true" frameborder="0" class="html-block-iframe"></iframe></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /></p> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p style="text-align: center;">&#171; <a href="http://etinjat.wikidot.com/">私人维度</a> | 基金会时空：中文分部-<a href="http://scp-zh-tr.wikidot.com/etinjat">繁中分部</a> | <a href="http://rpc-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/etinjat-s-personnel-file">管理局位面</a> &#187;</p> <p><a name="bottom"></a> [ <a href="#top">△ 回到顶部</a> ]</p> </div> <div class="pseudo-tags"> <ul> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/system:page-tags/tag/%E7%90%85%E5%AC%9B%E7%A6%8F%E5%9C%B0%E8%97%8F%E4%B9%A6%E9%98%81#pages">琅嬛阁主</a></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/system:page-tags/tag/%E6%96%87%E8%A8%80%E6%96%87#pages">异学祭酒</a></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/system:page-tags/tag/%E8%AF%97%E6%AD%8C#pages">远游骚客</a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;">阴阳之道</a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;">乌有之兽</a></li> <li><span style="text-decoration: line-through;"><a href="javascript:;">鸽子</a></span></li> <li><span style="text-decoration: line-through;"><a href="javascript:;">武陵人</a></span></li> </ul> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/etinjat" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4055881&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608102669" alt="Etinjat" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4055881)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/etinjat" >Etinjat</a></span></p> 
