> </div> <p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">选项6</span></strong><sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-563928-7" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >7</a></sup></p> <p><strong>它是什么样的：</strong></p> <div class="tape-wrap"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">播放</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">重播</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div class="tape-anim"> <div class="tape-left"></div> <div class="tape-right"></div> </div> <div class="tape-record"> <p><span class="record r1"><em>第一行</em><br /> <em>第二行</em><br /> <em>最后一行</em></span><br /> <span class="record r2"><em>文字</em><br /> <em>更多文字</em></span></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p><strong>复制这些：</strong></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p><strong>重要：</strong></p> <ul> <li>这部分应置于页面顶端。</li> <li>当你添加新“记录”时，使用以下格式添加新“选项”。 <ul> <li>.r3 {animation-delay: 9s;}<br /> .r4 {animation-delay: 12s;}</li> </ul> </li> </ul> <div class="code"> <pre> <code>[[module CSS]] /* //// 当你添加新的“记录”时， //// */ /* //// 使用以下格式添加新“选项”。 //// */ .r1 {animation-delay: 3s;} .r2 {animation-delay: 6s;} .tape-wrap .collapsible-block-unfolded-link .collapsible-block-link {animation-delay: calc(6s + 2s);} .tape-record {position: relative;height: 6em;pointer-events: none;}.record {display: block;position: absolute;width: 100%;animation-name: record;animation-duration: 2.5s;opacity: 0;top: 0;text-align: center;}.tape-wrap {position: