class="hl-reserved">html</span><span class="hl-brackets">&gt;</span><span class="hl-code"> [[/html]]</span> </pre></div> </div> <p><strong>重要：</strong></p> <ul> <li>“登入”键不会在密码栏为空的情况下重新定向（打开目标网页）。</li> <li>此登入格式用于含有迭代的文档。将代码中的“将这里替换为登入后想要展示的网页地址”改为你的文档所使用的正确迭代链接。</li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> <p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">选项2—<em>更多选择</em></span></strong></p> <p><strong>它是什么样的：</strong></p> <div class="log-form"> <p><span class="logint"><br /> <br /> SCiPNET LOGIN<br /> <br /></span></p> <div class="input-container true-form"></div> <br /> <a class="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-style-resource" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-style-resource">链接</a></div> <div class="log-form"> <p><span class="logint"><br /> <br /> SCiPNET LOGIN<br /> <br /></span></p> <div class="input-container true-form"></div> <br /> <a class="btn-false" href="btn-false">Login</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">折叠</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">登出</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>文字</p> </div> </div> </div> <p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">复制这些：</span></strong></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <h3><span>链接选项：将你目标页面的网址（或&quot;/&quot;加上页面名称）写到&quot;url&quot;后面</span></h3> <blockquote> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[include</span> :scp-sandbox-3:component:login-module <strong>|url=<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-style-resource</span></strong>|id=&lt;你的ID&gt;|pw=&lt;你的密码&gt;|disc=true<strong>|value=链接</strong><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">]]</span></p> </blockquote> <h3><span>折叠选项：将要显示的文字写到折叠块中</span></h3> <blockquote> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[include&#32;:scp-sandbox-3:component:login-module&#32;|id=&lt;你的ID&gt;|pw=&lt;你的密码&gt;|disc=true]]</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[collapsible&#32;show=&quot;折叠&quot;&#32;hide=&quot;登出&quot;]]</span><br /> 文字<br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[/collapsible]]</span></p> </blockquote> <h3><span>其它……？</span></h3> <table class="wiki-content-table"> <tr> <th>参数</th> <th>是否必填</th> <th>允许的值</th> <th>描述</th> </tr> <tr> <td>id</td> <td><strong>是</strong></td> <td>文字</td> <td>ID值</td> </tr> <tr> <td>pw</td> <td><strong>是</strong></td> <td>文字</td> <td>密码值</td> </tr> <tr> <td>url</td> <td>否</td> <td><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">http://example.com</span><br /> /pagename</td> <td>当为空<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-563928-22" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >22</a></sup>时，链接按钮将不会出现</td> </tr> <tr> <td>value</td> <td>否</td> <td>文字</td> <td>链接按钮上的文字</td> </tr> <tr> <td>disc</td> <td>否</td> <td>true<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-563928-23" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >23</a></sup></td> <td>当不为空时，密码将不会被显示</td> </tr> <tr> <td>title</td> <td>否</td> <td>文字<br /> 链接</td> <td>标题文字</td> </tr> </table> </div> </div> </div> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <div style="border-bottom:2px solid #777; margin-bottom:1px;"></div> <div style="border-bottom:1px solid #777;"></div> <h2><span>自定义插图方块格式</span></h2> <p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">选项1</span></strong><sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-563928-24" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >24</a></sup></p> <p><strong>它是什么样的：</strong></p> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:300px;"><img src="http://smlt.wikidot.com/local--files/mrpines:choo-choo/train3.jpg" style="width:300px;" class="enlarge" alt="train3.jpg" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:300px;"> <p>将鼠标移至图片上方来放大。</p> </div> </div> <p><strong>复制这些：</strong></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div class="code"> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[include&#32;:scp-sandbox-3:image-zoom&#32;name={$name}|caption={$caption}|width=300px|align=right]]</span></p> </div> <p>将<strong>{$name}</strong>改为指向图片的文件名或链接。将<strong>{$caption}</strong>改为图片下方所显示的文字描述。图片的宽度（width）及对齐方式（align）都被设定为标准SCP文档格式，但它们同样可以被修改。</p> </div> </div> </div> <p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">选项2</span></strong><sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-563928-25" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >25</a></sup></p> <p><strong>它是什么样的：</strong></p> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:300px;"><img src="http://smlt.wikidot.com/local--files/mrpines:choo-choo/train3.jpg" style="width:300px;" class="unblur" alt="train3.jpg" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:300px;"> <p>将鼠标移至图片上方来查看。</p> </div> </div> <p><strong>复制这些：</strong></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div class="code"> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[include&#32;:scp-sandbox-3:image-blur&#32;name={$name}|caption={$caption}|width=300px|align=right]]</span></p> </div> <p>将<strong>{$name}</strong>改为指向图片的文件名或链接。将<strong>{$caption}</strong>改为图片下方所显示的文字描述。图片的宽度（width）及对齐方式（align）都被设定为标准SCP文档格式，但它们同样可以被修改。</p> </div> </div> </div> <p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">选项3</span></strong><sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-563928-26" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >26</a></sup></p> <p><strong>它是什么样的：</strong></p> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:300px;"><img src="http://smlt.wikidot.com/local--files/mrpines:choo-choo/train3.jpg" title="Click and hold to enlarge." style="width:300px;" class="fillpg" alt="train3.jpg" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:300px;"> <p>按住不放来放大图片。</p> </div> </div> <p><strong>复制这些：</strong></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div class="code"> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[include&#32;:scp-sandbox-3:component:image-zoom-2&#32;name={$name}|caption={$caption}|width=300px|align=right]]</span></p> </div> <p><strong>重要：</strong>如果你的文件扩展名不是.png或.jpg的话，此组件将无法正常工作。</p> <p>将<strong>{$name}</strong>改为指向图片的文件名或链接。将<strong>{$caption}</strong>改为图片下方所显示的文字描述。图片的宽度（width）及对齐方式（align）都被设定为标准SCP文档格式，但它们同样可以被修改。</p> </div> </div> </div> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <div style="border-bottom:2px solid #777; margin-bottom:1px;"></div> <div style="border-bottom:1px solid #777;"></div> <h2><span>图像轮播框</span></h2> <div class="carousel-container center" style="width: calc(300px + 34px);"><iframe src="http://sc