out/1'); /*== 变量 ==*/ :root { /* 背景颜色（默认：white） */ --fadeout-background: white; /* 淡出持续时间 */ --fadeout-time: 1s; /* 剪裁页眉（来消除页眉下方的阴影） 如果你使用默认Sigma-9以外的版式，请修改此变量。 */ --cropped-header: url(http://smlt.wdfiles.com/local--files/ukwhatn:fadeout/header-crop.png); } [[/module]]</code> </pre></div> <p><span style="font-size:125%;"><strong>淡出部分</strong></span></p> <p>只有“fadeout-wrapper”内的元素会被擦除。<br /> <strong><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[span&#32;class=&quot;escape&quot;]]文本[[/span]]</span></strong>不会被擦除。此元素可以使用任意次数，无大小限制。</p> <div class="code"> <pre> <code>正常内容 [[div_ class=&quot;fadeout-wrapper&quot;]] 擦除内容 [[span class=&quot;escape&quot;]]正常内容[[/span]] 擦除内容 [[collapsible show=&quot;点击淡出&quot; hide=&quot; &quot;]] [[div class=&quot;cover&quot;]] @@@@ [[/div]] [[/collapsible]] [[/div]] 正常内容</code> </pre></div> </div> </div> </div> <br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>选项2：在淡出后显示图片</strong></span><sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-563928-37" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >37</a></sup> <p><strong>它是什么样的：</strong></p> <div style="padding-left: 1em"> <p>正常内容</p> <div class="fadeout-wrapper">擦除内容<br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">点击淡出</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">&nbsp;</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div class="cover"> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> </div> <div class="fadein-img"> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><img src="http://smlt.wdfiles.com/local--files/ukwhatn%3Afadeout/sample.jpg" alt="sample.jpg" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p>正常内容</p> </div> <br /> <strong>复制这些：</strong><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <hr /> <p><span style="font-size:125%;"><strong>CSS模块</strong></span></p> <p>可以使用变量来自定义一些元素。</p> <div class="code"> <pre> <code>[[module css]] @import url('http://smlt.wdfiles.com/local--code/ukwhatn%3Afadeout/1'); /*== 变量 ==*/ :root { /* 背景颜色（默认：white） */ --fadeout-background: white; /* 淡出持续时间 */ --fadeout-time: 1s; /* 图片淡入持续时间（用于选项2） */ --img-fadein-time: 1s; /* 图片淡入延迟（用于选项2） */ --img-fadein-delay: 2s; /* 剪裁页眉（来消除页眉下方的阴影） 如果你使用默认Sigma-9以外的版式，请修改此变量。 */ --cropped-header: url(http://smlt.wdfiles.com/local--files/ukwhatn:fadeout/header-crop.png); } [[/module]]</code> </pre></div> <p><span style="font-size:125%;"><strong>淡出部分</strong></span></p> <p>只有“fadeout-wrapper”内的元素会被擦除。<br /> <strong><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[span&#32;class=&quot;escape&quot;]]文本[[/span]]</span></strong>不会被擦除。此元素可以使用任意次数，大小无限制。</p> <div class="code"> <pre> <code>正常内容 [[div_ class=&quot;fadeout-wrapper&quot;]] 擦除内容 [[collapsible show=&quot;点击淡出&quot; hide=&quot; &quot;]] [[div class=&quot;cover&quot;]] @@ @@ [[/div]] [[div_ class=&quot;fadein-img&quot;]] [[=image [图片URL]]] [[/div]] [[/collapsible]] [[/div]] 正常内容</code> </pre></div> </div> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cynthia7979" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3687969&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608102673" alt="Cynthia7979" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3687969)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cynthia7979" >Cynthia7979</a></span></p> <div class="footnotes-footer"> <div class="title">脚注</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-563928-1"><a href="javascript:;" >1</a>. 如<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-2682">SCP-2682</a>中所见</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-563928-2"><a href="javascript:;" >2</a>. 如<a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-2832">SCP-2832</a>中所见</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-563928-3"><a href="javascript:;" >3</a>. 如<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-2571">SCP-2571</a>中所见</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-563928-4"><a href="javascript:;" >4</a>. 如<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1730">SCP-1730</a>中所见</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-563928-5"><a href="javascript:;" >5</a>. 如<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-2409">SCP-2409</a>中所见</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-563928-6"><a href="javascript:;" >6</a>. 如<a href="http://ja.scp-wiki.net/ykamikura-6">蒲公英开花时（日分故事）</a>中所见</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-563928-7"><a href="javascript:;" >7</a>. 如<a href="http://ja.scp-wiki.net/cassette-tape-1006-1">音频卡带#1006-1（日分故事）</a>、<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/spc-710-jp">SPC-710-JP</a>及<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-3648">SCP-3648</a>中所见<br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><em>※<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-3648">SCP-3648</a>仅使用了音频卡带动画。</em></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><em>※音频卡带图片由日本分部的<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/indonootoko" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3461191&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608102673" alt="indonootoko" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3461191)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/indonootoko" >indonootoko</a></span>制作。</em></span></div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-563928-8"><a href="javascript:;" >8</a>. 如<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4224">SCP-4224</a>、<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-3241">SCP-3241</a>及<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/apas">自动化无源记忆删除系统 Ver. 17.09</a>中所见</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-563928-9"><a href="javascript:;" >9</a>. 如<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-835">SCP-835</a>中所见</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-563928-10"><a href="javascript:;" >10</a>. 如<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-3143">SCP-3143</a>中所见</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-563928-11"><a href="javascript:;" >11</a>. 如<a href="http://ja.scp-wiki.net/indonootoko-s-proposal">SCP-001-JP</a>中所见</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-563928-12"><a href="javascript:;" >12</a>. 如<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4051">SCP-4051</a>中所见</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-563928-13"><a href="javascript:;" >13</a>. 图片来自<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/djkaktus" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1888434&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608102673" alt="djkaktus" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1888434)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/djkaktus" >djkaktus</a></span>的<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-3935">SCP-3935</a>。</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-563928-14"><a href="javascript:;" >14</a>. 如<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-2983">SCP-2983</a>等中所见</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-563928-15"><a href="javascript:;" >15</a>. 如<a href="http://ja.scp-wiki.net/scp-1970-jp">SCP-1970-JP</a>、<a href="http://ja.scp-wiki.net/scp-1370-jp">SCP-1370-JP</a>及<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4260">SCP-4260</a>中所见</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-563928-16"><a href="javascript:;" >16</a>. 如<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-3570">EE-3570</a>及<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4792">SCP-4792</a>中所见。版权归<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yossipossi" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2199269&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608102673" alt="Yossipossi" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2199269)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yossipossi" >Yossipossi</a></span>、<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lt-flops" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1735419&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608102673" alt="Lt Flops" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1735419)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lt-flops" >Lt Flops</a></span>及KindlyTurtleClem所有。</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-563928-17"><a href="javascript:;" >17</a>. <strong>译注：</strong>如中文汉字和符号</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-563928-18"><a href="javascript:;" >18</a>. 如<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4003">SCP-4003</a>中所见</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-563928-19"><a href="javascript:;" >19</a>. <strong>译注：</strong>由于是英文手写字体，中文无法显示</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-563928-20"><a href="javascript:;" >20</a>. <strong>来源：</strong><a href="http://scp-jp-sandbox2.wikidot.com/inc:fakeprot" target="_blank">http://scp-jp-sandbox2.wikidot.com/inc:fakeprot</a><br /> <strong>原作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nanimono-demonai" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1703549&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608102673" alt="Nanimono Demonai" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1703549)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nanimono-demonai" >Nanimono Demonai</a></span></div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-563928-21"><a href="javascript:;" >21</a>. 如<a href="http://ja.scp-wiki.net/scp-1370-jp">SCP-1370-JP</a>中所见</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-563928-22"><a href="javascript:;" >22</a>. <strong>译注：</strong>此处的“为空”指不存在该属性，如折叠块选项所示。下文相同。</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-563928-23"><a href="javascript:;" >23</a>. <strong>译注：</strong>即仅可使用“true”（不加引号）作为属性值。</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-563928-24"><a href="javascript:;" >24</a>. 如<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4224">SCP-4224</a>、<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4577">SCP-4577</a>、及<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-3662">SCP-3662</a>中所见</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-563928-25"><a href="javascript:;" >25</a>. 如<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/error-field-cannot-be-lloyd">错误：该字段不可为Lloyd</a>中所见</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-563928-26"><a href="javascript:;" >26</a>. 如<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/hawks-n-artworks">Hawks的艺术作品</a>中所见</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-563928-27"><a href="javascript:;" >27</a>. 由<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sekai-s" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4476849&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608102673" alt="Sekai_s" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4476849)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sekai-s" >Sekai_s</a></span>翻译至中分</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-563928-28"><a href="javascript:;" >28</a>. 由<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aiken-drum" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2061751&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608102673" alt="Aiken Drum" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2061751)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aiken-drum" >Aiken Drum</a></span>翻译至韩分</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-563928-29"><a href="javascript:;" >29</a>. 由<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/7happy7" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3427263&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608102673" alt="7happy7" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3427263)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/7happy7" >7happy7</a></span>翻译至日分</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-563928-30"><a href="javascript:;" >30</a>. 由<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jyj-52" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5378646&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608102673" alt="jyj_52" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5378646)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jyj-52" >jyj_52</a></span>翻译至意分</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-563928-31"><a href="javascript:;" >31</a>. 这两个选项的版权都归<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nanimono-demonai" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1703549&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608102673" alt="Nanimono Demonai" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1703549)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nanimono-demonai" >Nanimono Demonai</a></span>所有。</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-563928-32"><a href="javascript:;" >32</a>. 版权属于日本分部的<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/c-take" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2872372&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608102673" alt="C-take" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2872372)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/c-take" >C-take</a></span>。<br /> <strong>来源：</strong><a href="http://shitake-crude-production.wikidot.com/javascript:timeviewer" target="_blank">http://shitake-crude-production.wikidot.com/javascript:timeviewer</a></div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-563928-33"><a href="javascript:;" >33</a>. <strong>来源：</strong><a href="http://smlt.wikidot.com/boyu12:inc-loop" target="_blank">http://smlt.wikidot.com/boyu12:inc-loop</a><br /> <strong>原作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/boyu12" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3316163&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608102673" alt="Boyu12" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3316163)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/boyu12" >Boyu12</a></span></div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-563928-34"><a href="javascript:;" >34</a>. 图片来自<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/djkaktus" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1888434&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608102673" alt="djkaktus" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1888434)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/djkaktus" >djkaktus</a></span>的<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-3935">SCP-3935</a>。</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-563928-35"><a href="javascript:;" >35</a>. 如<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/apas">自动化无源记忆删除系统 Ver. 17.09</a>、<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/the-beast-beneath-the-library">图书馆下的野兽</a>及<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4415">SCP-4415</a>中所见</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-563928-36"><a href="javascript:;" >36</a>. 如<a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1630-jp">SCP-1630-JP</a>及<a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1286-jp">SCP-1286-JP</a>中所见</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-563928-37"><a href="javascript:;" >37</a>. 示例图片<a href="https://www.goodfreephotos.com/public-domain-images/wide-hiking-path.jpg.php" target="_blank">宽阔的徒步小径</a>属于CC0</div> </div> 
